        "y0": 0.8492526917446255,
        "x1": 0.8907504554556197,
        "y1": 0.8622088670164276
      },
      "text": "Form now on we represent distinct partitions as Young diagrams under the ladder. With these",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
